{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51729","headline":"简州（句） 二 · 范禹偁","name":"简州（句） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绕城山雪自粧点，三县人烟共接连。\n（《舆地纪胜》一四五《简州》）（〖1〗《全唐诗》无范禹偁诗，兹据《十国春秋》卷五三补传：范禹偁，九陇人。\n天成中登第，孟知祥以爲蒙阳令，入侍太子。\n後蜀後主孟昶嗣位後，累兼翰林学士，曾兼简州刺史。\n蜀亡，从後主归宋，授鸿胪卿，开宝三年尚在世。\n〖参张忱石考证〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范禹偁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}